       *> META - record layout of __meta__ (generated by rulebook-to-cobol).
       *> Use: COPY META REPLACING ==:P:== BY ==<prefix>== under a level
       *> 01-10 group. Record length: 4591 bytes.
       *> A NULL field has <name>-NI = "Y"; text is <name>-LEN bytes of <name>;
       *> booleans are "Y"/"N"; numbers are packed decimal.
       *> MetaKey (raw, string)
           15 :P:-META-KEY-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-META-KEY PIC X(64).
       *> Name (calculated, string)
           15 :P:-NAME-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-NAME-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-NAME PIC X(64).
       *> ValueType (raw, string)
           15 :P:-VALUE-TYPE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-VALUE-TYPE PIC X(64).
       *> StringValue (raw, string)
           15 :P:-STRING-VALUE-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-STRING-VALUE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-STRING-VALUE PIC X(1702).
       *> JsonValue (raw, string)
           15 :P:-JSON-VALUE-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-JSON-VALUE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-JSON-VALUE PIC X(2684).
